At that time the driver of the lorry bearing Registration No.KA 01C 7729, drove the lorry in a rash and negligent manner in the same direction and suddenly stopped the lorry, due to which,
the car dashed on the rear side of the lorry and the accident occurred and Shrestra Yasaswi Gomos;
Asokan; Sudhakar; Aravindhan died and Sakthi Kathik sustained injuries.

The interest of 9% awarded by the Tribunal, in the opinion of this Court is high and hence, this Court is inclined to reduce the interest and accordingly the same is reduced to 7.5% p.a.
from 9% p.a. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis C.M.A.Nos.3380 of 2017, 1178 of 2014, 1649 of 2022,
