34.C.M.A.Nos.3380 of 2017, 1178 of 2014, 1814 of 2014 filed by the Royal Sundaram Alliance Insurance Company are partly allowed;
C.M.A.No.1649 of 2022 filed by the claimants in M.C.O.P.No.184 of 2011 is partly allowed;
C.M.A.Nos.2803 of 2022, 2801 of 2022 filed by Dillis are partly allowed; C.M.A.No.1938 of 2022 filed by the National Insurance Company is dismissed.

